# Allow-list: only what the image build needs. Everything else (private files, data, the venv,
# git history, caches, docs, tests) stays out of the build context.
*
!requirements.lock
!requirements-build.lock
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!LICENSE
!src/
!docker/healthcheck.py
src/**/__pycache__
src/**/*.pyc
